{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only singleprofile model using scvi_n200 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5203 (vs 0.4849 baseline in singleprofile setting). The result suggests scvi_n200 provides performance benefits over pca_n2000 in this configuration, though its effectiveness relative to multiprofile settings remains uncertain. The absence of image modality or fusion prevents assessment of multimodal integration potential."
}

